"Hello," you replied.
"May I sit?"
"Yes, please"
There were plenty of vacant tables, so you concluded that the man wanted to talk. But you needed some privacy to think over the situation you was in. In the meantime the waitress brought your tea. You drank it almost in one gulp and hurried to leave the table, because a fine idea to read about werewolfs in the internet came to your mind. You went outside the bar and took the cell phone off the neck.  This is what you managed to find: a person can become a werewolf not only after a bite. If one puts a wolf pelt on the back and reeds a spell, he becomes a werewolf. A werewolf is a very strong and sly creature. The best way to defeat it, is to drive a hawthorn stake through his body. You recollected, that a few days ago visited a country house of a friend of yours. And you actually tried a wolf pelt on there... You decided to take rest in the neighboring grove and in the evening go visit the scoundrel who had put a spell on you.  You hid in the shrubs and fell asleep, lulled by a peaceful buzzing of bees. When the kingdom of Morpheus released you, it was already dark. You was starving. You left your shelter and saw how the bearded man that sat to your table earlier went out of the bar.